OL,3,GNEWSAThatching work to begin at 13th
OL,4,ACentury barn
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 800-year old barn, thought to be one
OL,7,Fof the oldest remaining timber
OL,8,Fstructures in England, is to be
OL,9,Frethatched at a cost of #200,000.
OL,11,FThe Grade II listed Manorial Barn in
OL,12,FWhiston, near Rotherham, was saved from
OL,13,Fruin in the 1980s, when the local
OL,14,Fparish council stepped in to restore it
OL,15,Ffor community use.
OL,17,FOriginally constructed by medieval
OL,18,Fbuilders to store and process crops,
OL,19,Fthe building is now predominantly used
OL,20,Fas a wedding venue.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
