OL,3,GNEWSAThatching work to begin at 13th
OL,4,ACentury barn
OL,5,
OL,6,FTony Griffin, from Whiston Parish
OL,7,FCouncil, said: "The barn predates
OL,8,Falmost everything in the area that's
OL,9,Fleft standing. It is something that
OL,10,Fvery few places have got anything
OL,11,Fsimilar."
